    "excerpt": "她就住在 DSH 里。 裙摆、发梢和尾巴会轻轻飘动。头顶小标签显示梁文峰 / 梁文谷时段和账户余额；时段切换时她会换个表情告诉你。 She lives inside DSH. Her skirt, hair ends and tail sway gently. Chips above her head show the DeepSeek pricing period (梁文峰 = peak, 梁文谷 = off-peak) and your balance; she announces each period switch with a new expr"
